<title>UK: Dalgety commercial director to retire.</title>
<headline>Dalgety commercial director to retire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British agribusiness group Dalgety Plc said on Wednesday its commercial director Robert Harris would retire from the board on September 30 this year, when he will also relinquish his executive responsibilities.</p>
<p>Harris joined Dalgety in April 1965, became a director of Spillers Limited when it was bought by Dalgety in 1980 and joined the board as commercial director in 1987.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
